{
  "title": "Omega",
  "children": [
    {
      "title": "Overview",
      "lines": [
        "Techno kick synth:",
        "a kick engine, a",
        "rumble, a 9-voice",
        "sequencer,",
        "and a master glue",
        "stage, in one slot.",
        "",
        "Any note fires the",
        "kick. Its pitch is",
        "set by Pitch, not",
        "by the note played.",
        "Velocity sets level."
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Pages",
      "lines": [
        "Jog moves through:",
        " Main - engine, vol",
        " Kick 1 - pitch,",
        "  length, curve and",
        "  the engine's own",
        "  controls",
        " Kick 2 - transient,",
        "  filter, kick FX",
        " Rumble, Sequence,",
        "  Effects, Space",
        " Performer - duck,",
        "  DJ filter, glue",
        "",
        "Knobs 1-8 edit the",
        "page on screen."
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Engines",
      "lines": [
        "Model picks one:",
        " FM 2-Op - clean,",
        "  punchy default",
        " FM 4-Op - choose",
        "  an Algorithm",
        " Wavetable - body",
        "  wave plus click",
        " Physical - beater,",
        "  shell, head",
        " Hard - sample",
        "  layer under body",
        " Digital - bit",
        "  reduced waves",
        " Transistor - 909",
        "  click to snap",
        " Analog - 808 sub",
        " User - your WAVs",
        "",
        "Kick 1's last knobs",
        "change with Model."
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Rumble + Seq",
      "children": [
        {
          "title": "Rumble",
          "lines": [
            "Ghost copies of the",
            "kick on the 16th",
            "grid, synced to",
            "tempo. No feedback,",
            "so it cannot run",
            "away.",
            "",
            "Rumble Vol: to noon",
            "is level; past noon",
            "it drives into the",
            "filter (and a bit",
            "after), loudness",
            "about even.",
            "Length: short =",
            " distinct ghosts,",
            " long = smeared",
            " sub rumble.",
            "Tap 1-4: level of",
            " each 16th copy.",
            "Lowpass darkens it."
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Sequence",
          "lines": [
            "A note sequence",
            "that plays while",
            "the transport runs.",
            "Steps lock to the",
            " beat: step 1 is",
            " on the downbeat.",
            "",
            "Seq Vol: to noon is",
            "level; past noon it",
            "drives the voice's",
            "filter.",
            "",
            "Scale: 12 scales or",
            " Unquantized.",
            "Root: 20-520 Hz.",
            "Range: span, in",
            " scale degrees.",
            "Seed 0-127: each",
            " value is a new",
            " pattern.",
            "Sequence Length:",
            " 1-64 steps.",
            "Density: Euclidean",
            " fill. Rotate:",
            " shift +/-32 steps.",
            "Reset: restart",
            " every 1-8 bars or",
            " on each note."
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Seq Voices",
          "lines": [
            "Voice picks the",
            "sound; the next two",
            "knobs change with",
            "it (each voice",
            "keeps its own):",
            " Basic - Wave,",
            " Fold",
            " Detune - Wave,",
            " Detune: 0 to -40",
            " cents, then -5,",
            " -7, -12 (sub)",
            " FM - Wave, FM Amt",
            " (1:1, fades with",
            " the note)",
            " Acid Saw/Sq - Res,",
            " Env Amt (303-ish",
            " sweep). Slide on",
            " Seq Variation.",
            " Dirt - Noise,",
            " Noise>Flt",
            " Dirt 2 - FM Amt,",
            " Noise>Flt",
            " Bleep - Wave,",
            " Blip (pitch flick)",
            " Stab - Wave,",
            " Chord: 5th+Oct,",
            " Minor, Sus4, Min7",
            "Filter: the voice's",
            " own cutoff."
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Seq Variation",
          "lines": [
            "Pattern: how notes",
            " walk - Random, Up,",
            " Down, Ping-Pong,",
            " Leap, Pedal - or a",
            " techno riff:",
            " Offbeat, Rolling,",
            " Acid, Call+Resp,",
            " Stabs, Octaves.",
            "Accent: louder,",
            " brighter accents.",
            "Decay: note hold +",
            " tail (each voice",
            " has its own shape).",
            "Oct Jump, Ratchet,",
            " Note Rnd: per-step",
            " dice.",
            "Slide: acid voices",
            " tie into the next",
            " note and glide.",
            "Loop 1-16 repeats",
            " the same dice;",
            " Free rerolls."
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Effects",
          "lines": [
            "Drive (rough, can",
            "sit after the",
            "reverb), an LFO on",
            "the filter and",
            "reverb tone, and a",
            "gritty warehouse",
            "reverb:",
            " Warehouse - big",
            "  shed, a bit dirty",
            " Concrete - tight",
            "  bunker slap",
            " Tunnel - long",
            "  pre-delay flutter",
            " Dirt - 6-bit,",
            "  decimated tail",
            "Reverb: how much",
            "of the room you",
            "hear (its return).",
            "Space picks what",
            "goes into it.",
            "Decay: room size.",
            "Tone: dark-bright.",
            "",
            "FX Order sets the",
            "chain: rumble,",
            "drive and reverb",
            "in any of four",
            "orders."
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Space",
          "lines": [
            "Top row: sends",
            "into the reverb.",
            " Rmb>Rev - rumble",
            " Seq>Rev - sequence",
            " Kick>Rev - kick",
            " Dly>Rev - echoes",
            "Bottom row: a",
            "tempo-synced echo",
            "on the sequence.",
            " Seq Dly - send",
            " Time - 1/16 to",
            "  dotted 1/4",
            " Fdbk - repeats",
            " Tone - left dark,",
            "  right thin"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Performer",
      "lines": [
        "Master stage.",
        "",
        "Duck: dips the",
        " rumble+seq lows on",
        " each kick. Release,",
        " Slew and Frequency",
        " shape the dip.",
        "DJ Filter: centre",
        " is off; left is",
        " lowpass, right is",
        " highpass.",
        "Compressor Drive:",
        " one knob of bus",
        " glue."
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Own Samples",
      "lines": [
        "The User engine",
        "plays 16-bit WAVs",
        "from the module's",
        "samples folder,",
        "up to 8, picked",
        "with Sample.",
        "",
        "Put them in:",
        "modules/",
        " sound_generators/",
        " omega/samples/",
        "",
        "Reload the slot to",
        "see new files."
      ]
    }
  ]
}
